 126:MidiHandler.h ****      *  (the abort-complete IRQ it waits for is NVIC-disabled), so MIDI-in
 127:MidiHandler.h ****      *  died permanently. CheckError() latches the error; a stop+start
 128:MidiHandler.h ****      *  recovers (HAL_UART_Receive_DMA clears the error code). This must
 129:MidiHandler.h ****      *  not run in the audio ISR: DmaListenStart re-inits HAL with
 130:MidiHandler.h ****      *  tick-based timeouts that freeze inside an ISR. */
